            </h2>
            <div id="faq-1" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body pt-0 pb-2">
                    <p class="mb-1 fnt-3 lh-lg fw-medium">We specialize in house refurbishments, including bathroom fitting, kitchen remodeling, tiling, flooring, painting,
                        plastering, plumbing, and electrical work.</p>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="accordion-item accordion-item-style-1 rounded1-3">
            <h2 class="accordion-header">
                <button class="accordion-button collapsed rounded1-3" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
