                    <h3 class="fnt-1 fw-bold">Do I need to vacate my home during the refurbishment?</h3>
                </button>
            </h2>
            <div id="faq-8" class="accordion-collapse collapse" data-bs-parent="#faqAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body pt-0 pb-2">
